{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-not-optimized",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "composer/autoload.php is there, but composer.json does not set config.optimize-autoloader, so no class map is dumped at release time and every class is looked up in the file system."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route-unreferenced",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "POST /index.php/apps/integration_immich/api/v1/download  integration_immich.assets.downloadassets  appinfo/routes.php:11 routes",
        "GET /index.php/apps/integration_immich/api/v1/locked/oauth/callback  integration_immich.locked.oauthcallback  appinfo/routes.php:11 routes"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 2 routes outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 31 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  POST /index.php/apps/integration_immich/api/v1/download  integration_immich.assets.downloadassets  appinfo/routes.php:11 routes",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/integration_immich/api/v1/locked/oauth/callback  integration_immich.locked.oauthcallback  appinfo/routes.php:11 routes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
